Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:31.65,Disclosure,,0,0,0,,SIMULATOR / AI VOICE / RECORDED REPAIR / WAITS SHORTENED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:01.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,An order fills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Its reply disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Should an AI agent buy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:08.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Statebound makes that decision inspectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:12.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,This experiment starts with a twenty dollar budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every order here is simulated.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.82,0:00:17.10,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  01  /  THE QUESTION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:21.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,We run a fresh search over the plan and its fault model.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,One missing reply leads to a blind retry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:28.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirty dollars leaves a twenty dollar mandate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:31.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,The checker computes the path you see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.10,0:00:32.70,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  02  /  FIND THE FAILURE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Look at the two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:40.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,The exchange has filled the order, but the agent only knows it might have filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:43.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,An old balance cannot erase that uncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:46.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fifteen dollars remains exposed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.70,0:00:48.34,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  03  /  INSPECT EXPOSURE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:53.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now we load the repair written in our development Codex session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:57.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,It queries the original attempt before buying again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:02.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,We validate and recheck that candidate here, with the same mandate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Loading it is not a new AI call.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.34,0:01:07.66,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  04  /  CHECK THE AI REPAIR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:11.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,When the lookup confirms the fill, the goal completes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:15.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Replay uses the same interpreter and a persistent ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,The original uncertain attempt is never submitted a second time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.66,0:01:22.82,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  05  /  CONFIRM THE GOAL
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:25.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,But a lookup may stay inconclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:29.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here, the run ends unresolved and the reservation remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Statebound reports that limit honestly: containing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:37.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,risk and finishing the task are separate outcomes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.82,0:01:39.42,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  06  /  PRESERVE UNCERTAINTY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:42.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Export the evidence, then verify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:46.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,A separate verifier recomputes the transitions and the bounded
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:51.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,search, without asking a language model to judge its own answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,The plan, observations and results stay inspectable.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.42,0:01:56.26,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  07  /  VERIFY INDEPENDENTLY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:59.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Binance data also drives a separate experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:05.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,The official command line tool supplies a recorded testnet price and lot sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:08.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those inputs change the model and its debit amounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,We recheck the saved repair against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:14.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fees and execution remain simulated.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.26,0:02:15.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  08  /  BINANCE INPUTS TO VERDICT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:22.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Try the four cases yourself in the public Evidence Lab, or reproduce the checks from GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:27.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hosted Binance MCP is not connected, and no real trade is placed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:30.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Statebound: evidence before execution.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.00,0:02:31.65,Chapter,,0,0,0,,STATEBOUND  /  09  /  EXPLORE THE EVIDENCE
